[en_US]
bonus stage

This is a game where you play only the bonus stages from *Street Fighter II': Champion Edition*.

In the car-smashing stage, the time limit is set according to the character.
In the oil drum stage, the durability is increased regardless of the character.
The barrel stage has been expanded. This is the main game.


The car-smashing and drum-smashing stages?which serve as mere warm-ups?are actually designed to be difficult.
(Beginners should play as Ryu.)

